  {
   "id": "s003",
   "start": 6.8,
   "end": 11.3,
   "line": "On top of a pile of old cars sits a boy with headphones. His name is Ravi.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s004",
   "start": 11.3,
   "end": 15.12,
   "line": "He doesn't get up. He doesn't even look at you. He just lifts one finger.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s005",
   "start": 15.12,
   "end": 17.5,
   "line": "And the car underneath him starts to float.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s006",
   "start": 17.5,
   "end": 23.48,
   "line": "So what if you could move things just by thinking? No hands. No strings.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s007",
   "start": 23.48,
   "end": 25.4,
   "line": "First, physics wants to talk about the bill.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s008",
   "start": 25.4,
   "end": 29.88,
   "line": "Lifting a car two metres takes about thirty thousand joules of energy.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s009",
   "start": 29.88,
   "end": 33.74,
   "line": "Physics doesn't care if you use your arms, a crane, or your brain.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s010",
   "start": 33.74,
   "end": 36.48,
   "line": "And your brain runs on about twenty watts.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s011",
   "start": 36.48,
   "end": 37.94,
   "line": "Less than an old light bulb.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s012",
   "start": 37.94,
   "end": 39.6,
   "line": "If all of it went into lifting,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s013",
   "start": 39.6,
   "end": 42.52,
